    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Exceptional Mixed-Use Commercial & Residential Opportunity\r\n\r\nWe are delighted to present this unique mixed-use commercial and residential property to the market, ideally located on Bridge Street in the heart of the town centre. Within walking distance of cafés, restaurants, schools, shops, and all local amenities, the property offers an excellent opportunity for owner-occupiers, investors, or those seeking a live-work lifestyle.\r\n\r\nComprising two adjoining three-storey buildings with separate entrances, the property was formerly home to a jewellery, gun, and fishing tackle business. Full of character and original features, it offers exceptional flexibility and development potential.\r\n\r\nThe accommodation includes an impressive retail frontage with original timber and glass display cabinetry, an entrance hall, sitting room, spacious kitchen/dining area, ground-floor bedroom with en-suite, storeroom, and a private rear garden.\r\n\r\nUpstairs, there are four well-proportioned bedrooms, a family bathroom, hot press, attic space, and four additional multi-purpose rooms, providing a range of possibilities to suit individual requirements.\r\n\r\nTo the rear, a former bakery building presents further development opportunities, subject to the necessary planning permissions. The property also benefits from rear access and private on-site parking.\r\n\r\nConnected to mains water and sewerage and offered with vacant possession, this is a rare opportunity to acquire a distinctive property with enormous potential in a prime town centre location."
      },
